#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1337
msgid ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd shares XMPP and MQTT authentication.\n"
"You can use your XMPP credentials to connect\n"
"to the MQTT broker on the same domain.\n"
"\n"
"Per-account mode uses these credentials automatically."
msgstr ""
"ℹ Serveris: ejabberd (aptiktas mod_mqtt)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd naudoja bendrą XMPP ir MQTT tapatybės patvirtinimą.\n"
"Galite naudoti savo XMPP prisijungimo duomenis jungdamiesi\n"
"prie MQTT brokerio tame pačiame domene.\n"
"\n"
"Atskiros paskyros režimas šiuos duomenis naudoja automatiškai."

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1345
msgid ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody's MQTT bridge does NOT support authentication.\n"
"Any client on the network can subscribe to topics.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations:\n"
"• Restrict MQTT port via firewall\n"
"• Use TLS for encryption\n"
"• Do not publish sensitive data\n"
"\n"
"Topic format: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"
msgstr ""
"⚠ Serveris: Prosody (aptiktas mod_pubsub_mqtt)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody MQTT tiltas NEPALAIKO tapatybės patvirtinimo.\n"
"Bet kuris tinklo klientas gali prenumeruoti temas.\n"
"\n"
"Rekomendacijos:\n"
"• Apribokite MQTT prievadą užkardoje\n"
"• Šifravimui naudokite TLS\n"
"• Neskelbkite slaptų duomenų\n"
"\n"
"Temos formatas: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"

